# RemBoot menu config — place as "remboot.conf" in the root of the volume
# that holds your ISOs (the exFAT data partition), or on the ESP.
#
# One record per ISO. Keys are case-insensitive; blank lines and lines
# starting with # or ; are ignored. Only ISO: is required.
#
#   ISO:      the exact filename on disk (this is what actually boots)
#   NAME:     clean display name (defaults to the filename without .iso)
#   VERSION:  shown right-aligned, dimmed
#   POSITION: menu order; lower first. Entries without a POSITION come after
#             the positioned ones, sorted alphabetically by name.

ISO: Win11_25H2_Dutch_x64_v2.iso
NAME: Windows 11 25H2 (NL)
VERSION: 25H2
POSITION: 1

ISO: ubuntu-26.04-desktop-amd64.iso
NAME: Ubuntu Desktop
VERSION: 26.04 LTS
POSITION: 2

ISO: memtest.iso
NAME: MemTest86+
VERSION: 8.10
POSITION: 3

ISO: systemrescue-13.02-amd64.iso
NAME: SystemRescue
VERSION: 13.02
POSITION: 4

ISO: gparted-live-1.8.1-3-amd64.iso
NAME: GParted Live
VERSION: 1.8.1
POSITION: 5

ISO: HBCD_PE_x64.iso
NAME: Hiren's BootCD PE
VERSION: x64

ISO: rescuezilla-2.6.2-64bit.resolute.iso
NAME: Rescuezilla
VERSION: 2.6.2

ISO: shredos-2025.11_31_i686_v0.42_20260716_lite.iso
NAME: ShredOS
VERSION: 0.42

ISO: Dell_Pro_Max_with_GB10_FCM1253_WW_DGX_OS7_OTA3_Recovery_Image.iso
NAME: Dell Pro Max Recovery (DGX OS7)
VERSION: OTA3
